From 47e39a7b90b5f64c61bd45e00aa12a9d6d76f6c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lioilsources <ge.eoli@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:47:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] RL: headless env server for reinforcement learning (botInput
 hook, kills/shop/next/launch)

TyrianGame.botInput overrides desktop input so an agent can fly the ship.
test/rl/rl_server_test.dart runs the game without a window inside
flutter test and serves it over TCP as JSON lines: reset, step, sector
kill counters, and the ComCenter shop (next, shop, launch) for campaign
runs. Used by the T-Mobile L40S sandbox UC4 (tmobile-sandbox/uc4).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015YCooDvJpUCnCSBk6jiQCj
